DERIVATION AND ATTRIBUTION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is a derivative work of SimpleLogin:

    https://github.com/simple-login/app
    Copyright (C) SimpleLogin / Proton AG
    Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0

It is a ground-up reimplementation for the Cloudflare stack (TypeScript on
Workers + D1 + KV + Email Routing/Sending) rather than a copy of the Python
source, but it is a derivative work in substance and is therefore released
under the same licence:

  * Its compatibility contract was extracted from the upstream source. The
    files under specs/ cite upstream paths and line numbers throughout, and
    source comments cite the upstream function they port.
  * It deliberately reproduces upstream's HTTP API field-for-field and
    status-code-for-status-code, so that unmodified SimpleLogin client
    applications work against it.
  * The server-rendered dashboard templates under templates/ are ports of
    upstream's Jinja templates (converted to nunjucks).
  * static/ is vendored from upstream's static/ directory largely unchanged,
    and retains the licences of its own bundled third-party components.

Front-end vendor libraries are installed from npm at build time (see
package.json and scripts/build-assets.mjs) and remain under their own
licences.

